###
### Health check (should say "API is running")
GET http://localhost:3000

###
### Get all tickets
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tickets

###
### Create a ticket (should be 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Mouse not working",
    "description": "My mouse stopped clicking",
    "priority": "low",
    "category": "hardware"
}

###
### Get one ticket
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/1

###
### Get one ticket that doesn't exist (should be 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/99

###
### Update a ticket's status
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "closed"
}

### Update a ticket that doesn't exist (should be 404)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/99
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "closed"
}

###
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/3

### Delete a ticket that doesn't exist (should be 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/99